WEBVTT

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:09.330
Who're you?

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:14.840
Miss Mamechiyo.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.880
It appears the captain of the Kamogawa Rockr's has been returned.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.810
I feel like I'm going crazy

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:30.600
I like nice songs

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:35.030
and I want you to listen to them too

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:39.700
Whenever

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:45.660
I sing a song

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:49.250
I hear a voice coming from the microphone

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.710
wishing me the best

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:54.420
I want you

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:55.960
to hear it too

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:56.840
Good luck!

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:00.970
You can't show your love

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:06.510
just with niceties

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:11.390
That won't provide comfort

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:15.730
Whenever I say something

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:21.820
out of the ordinary

00:01:22.570 --> 00:01:25.160
in my heart

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:27.660
I wish you the best

00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:30.210
I want you

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:31.830
to hear that line

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:32.830
Good luck!

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:52.480
This is for coming to save me.

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:56.440
But we didn't do anything...

00:01:56.440 --> 00:02:00.150
Huh? Oh, Shuten just said you could le—

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:07.530
It's thanks for saving you from Shuten's gang and saving the festival, right?

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:08.240
Yeah.

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:09.620
All right! One stone for us!

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:14.370
That Shuten Doji looks like he's still planning something,

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:16.750
but I'll have concert security take care of the rest.

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:25.140
Misa, is that a Moonlight...

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:29.140
I mean, a jinxed stone?

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:30.020
Yeah.

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:34.640
People say you'll get sick or die young if you have one.

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:35.850
Really?

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:39.770
I'm sure it's just a superstition.

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:40.780
Isn't that...

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:43.950
Hm? That's Mamechiyo, isn't it?

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:46.070
She's looking this way...

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:47.910
Doesn't she look like she wants to join us?

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:49.950
Um, if you'd—

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:51.750
Please pretend you don't see her.

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:53.750
She thinks she's actually hiding like that.

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:55.420
Wow, a maiko!

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:59.040
Hey, can any of you draw?

00:02:59.210 --> 00:02:59.290
Kiyomizu Temple
Rock Explosion

