00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:01.880
The program cover isn't done yet.
Kiyomizu Temple
Rock Explosion

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:04.670
Our guitarist, Ebisu, was tasked with it,

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:07.010
but he'll be out of commission for some time.

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:08.680
Oh, Yukina, you should do it.

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:09.260
Huh?

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:11.810
Yeah, you can handle it, right?
The sketches are already done.

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:12.970
Seriously?

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:17.020
I just have to clean this up, right?

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:21.940
M-Mamechiyo, was it?

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:22.860
What is it?

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:31.740
Do you want to be friends?

00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:32.910
Huh?

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:37.170
O-Of course not!

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.420
I thought it looked pretty good...

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.930
Wh-Why don't we just go with a silhouette?

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:55.310
Maybe you should've just followed the sketches?

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:57.810
I <i>did</i> follow the sketches.

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:01.310
It's fine. I'm used to it.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:05.360
Yukippe, let's go.

