00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:14.200
Oh, wow!

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:15.790
That's so cute!

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:29.800
I couldn't find Miss Chiaya.

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:33.510
However, I think the Shuten gang on
Mount Oe has been up to something.

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:34.350
Misono Haruka
Misono Haruka
