President of Tokorozawa

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:43.690
I don't believe anyone else knows how to use the stones, though.

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:46.730
I'm sure they are gathering them.

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:47.860
Depending on what happens,

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:50.700
I may be able to bring them all back with me.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:54.280
There's not much time until the full moon.

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:55.740
Just hurry.

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:03.840
Why kidnap the Kamogawa captain?

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.500
I told you. I was just killing time.

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.920
Did she mention me, by any ch—

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:09.300
Nope, not at all.

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:15.640
Very well. Shuten, have you prepared anything for later?

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:17.970
A jack in the box, automaton, or something?

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:20.350
You'll just have to wait and see.

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:21.810
Jeez...

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:25.020
I'm not just trying to scare Ichijo Misa.

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:27.360
I'm gonna blow the whole festival away.

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:28.780
Blow it away?

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:32.820
That's Takumi-za's greatest masterpiece, the Kiyomizu Temple's fan-shaped stage.

00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:36.530
I've teamed up with some guys who wanna destroy that.

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:42.670
We've modified the Hall of the Lotus Queen's Thousand-Armed Kannon a little.

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:48.550
I told you, didn't I? I don't hold back when I'm killing time.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:50.220
Things are gonna get interesting.

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:59.270
Oh, my. You jest with the most horrid of delusions.

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:01.940
It is but an impossible and dull thought.

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:03.690
Dull...

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:06.400
Dull...

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:08.940
Dull?

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:11.280
Call Takumi-za.

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:14.780
We'll do something even more sensational!

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:17.280
Y-Yes, sir!

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:19.870
Ow...

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:21.410
You mustn't do such things.

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:26.710
Impostors ambling about will lessen the dignity of the geisha district.

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:28.130
Sorry...

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:30.050
We were looking for someone.

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:32.050
What's all the commotion?

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:36.050
They were sitting in front of Gion.

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:43.690
They're the same...

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:47.150
Did something happen between you two captains?

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:48.230
Nothing.

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:49.730
But she completely ignored you.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:51.940
This is none of your concern.

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:56.110
Um... Maybe Misa had a reason...

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:57.660
A reason?

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:01.740
I-I don't know what it is, but I get that feeling...

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:06.710
I've had enough.

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:24.350
I need a break.

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:25.850
You're out of shape, Han.

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:29.610
If Momizo sang, then it would be a Momi-Ham reunion.

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:30.110
Misa.

00:07:31.230 --> 00:07:33.860
Don't talk about him.

00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:37.700
Ma, you actually still want to perform, don't you?

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.320
That's...

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:42.040
I heard from Han before.

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:44.250
He told me why you broke up.

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:48.500
There was bad blood because of a member who left before your major debut.

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:50.340
Don't tell people that, Han.

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:54.010
Momizo fired him on his own.

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:58.510
His technique and resolve could've gotten better later.

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:02.260
"If you're serious, then fight to come back."

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:04.390
That's how Momizo felt.

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:05.770
I get it.

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:09.520
I still wanted to play with him though.

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:13.150
It's for him that I keep these sideburns.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:25.240
Chiyo...

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:39.510
Wow...

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:52.520
Are these Misa's memories?

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:53.060
Yeah.

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:55.360
Where did you buy this camera?

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:57.490
They were friends before, huh?

00:08:57.490 --> 00:08:59.200
Why are they like that now?

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:01.780
Hey, how much does that cost?

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:05.540
Isn't there anything we can do?

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:40.730
Someone stole your pick?

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:44.480
It's important to you, is it not?

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:47.780
It's fine. It's fine.

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:51.740
I'm counting on you guys...

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:53.570
Captain!

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:55.450
We'll look for it!

00:09:57.080 --> 00:09:58.910
We saw the person who took it!

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:00.620
Really?

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:04.500
It was dark, but we saw them fall and hit their forehead.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.380
We'll be able to tell right away by looking right here!

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:10.220
Everyone, please prepare for the festival!

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:11.260
We're counting on you!

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:12.510
Okay!

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:49.550
They're so pretty.

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:51.670
With these, we'll be together forever.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:52.800
Yeah.

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:55.430
You better not slack off during your maiko training.

00:10:57.430 --> 00:11:00.810
Let's do our best in our first and last contest!

00:11:00.810 --> 00:11:01.770
Yeah.

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:11.320
She will never come.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:14.360
I am nothing to her.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:21.660
Mamechiyo?

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:27.170
J-Just now, did you just...

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:28.380
Throw them away?

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:29.710
Why?

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.760
They were an eyesore.

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:36.550
The captain is useless without it!

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:38.550
You are too, aren't you?

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:42.310
If you didn't need that stone,
you should've said something!

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:44.230
Around there, maybe?

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:46.400
I think it was more to the right...

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:49.360
Wh-What...

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:17.380
How is she useless without it?

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:19.600
You of all people should know!

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:22.970
She won't be a Best without it.

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:26.350
I know! I'll look in those boxes.

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:29.810
We really can't do anything without a Best!

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:31.110
Huh?

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:35.110
Yukina, give me a ride.

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:36.280
Huh?!

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:39.280
Let's look together.

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:41.700
Why should I...

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:43.290
It's fine.

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:46.410
Even if you fight, you just have to make up.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:51.250
Please help!

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:02.640
Were they your sideburns?

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:23.200
You're the guy sniffing around about the jinxed stones, aren't you?

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:25.080
Unfortunately for you, there aren't any here.

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:28.330
What are you using them for?

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:29.210
Those stones are—

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:31.460
I know someone that wants them.

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:33.630
You want to go to space, too?

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:37.170
Sir! The countdown is—

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:38.720
What?

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:42.850
It looked dangerous, so I stopped it.

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:45.430
Bastard, you broke it!

00:13:45.430 --> 00:13:46.350
User's manual! Now!

00:13:47.270 --> 00:13:49.730
You're not stopping the festivities.

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.440
Oh, there's a stone!

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:59.240
I-I'm stuck!

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:01.780
Just let go if you want to get out.

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:04.780
There's a manual firing button for emergencies!

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:06.290
Where?

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:14.790
Oh, there's a button right here!

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:28.970
See ya, suckers!

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:51.000
Come on! Open, already! Open!

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:54.790
Um... Ai!

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:55.580
What?

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:56.460
Huh?!

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:01.550
Where's Misono Chiaya?

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:03.260
Th-That way!

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:21.820
Mother?

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:37.250
There they are!

00:15:50.350 --> 00:15:55.850
I bade that girl to not lead you astray that day.

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:13.000
It is my duty to raise you into a geisha.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.620
Yes, but—

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:19.250
I never thought she would shut you out so completely.

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:21.630
She is quite the single-minded child.

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:41.150
I know now that I must become a geisha,

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:46.990
but back then... I wanted anything but.

00:16:48.030 --> 00:16:54.330
Had she not been so cold to me, I may never have gained my resolve,

00:16:57.710 --> 00:17:02.770
but could we not have remained friends?

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:05.420
She will not even <i>speak</i> to me.

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:06.800
She was waiting for you.

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:09.760
Waiting for you to become a geisha.

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:20.810
